{"id": "3123621", "revid": "5350", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3123621", "title": "Sotos Y Carrizales Del R\u00edo Arag\u00f3n", "text": "Sotos Y Carrizales Del R\u00edo Arag\u00f3n este o arie protejat\u0103 (arie de protec\u021bie special\u0103 avifaunistic\u0103 \u2014 SPA) din Spania \u00eentins\u0103 pe o suprafa\u021b\u0103 de , integral pe uscat.\nLocalizare.\nCentrul sitului Sotos Y Carrizales Del R\u00edo Arag\u00f3n este situat la coordonatele .\n\u00cenfiin\u021bare.\nSitul Sotos Y Carrizales Del R\u00edo Arag\u00f3n a fost declarat arie de protec\u021bie special\u0103 avifaunistic\u0103 \u00een pentru a proteja 70 de specii de animale.\nBiodiversitate.\nSituat\u0103 \u00een ecoregiunea mediteranean\u0103, aria protejat\u0103 nu include niciun habitat protejat.\nLa baza desemn\u0103rii sitului se afl\u0103 mai multe specii protejate de p\u0103s\u0103ri (70): l\u0103car mare (\"Acrocephalus arundinaceus\"), l\u0103car-de-lac (\"Acrocephalus scirpaceus\"), fluierar de munte (\"Actitis hypoleucos\"), cioc\u00e2rlie-de-c\u00e2mp (\"Alauda arvensis\"), pesc\u0103ru\u0219 albastru (\"Alcedo atthis\"), ra\u021b\u0103 mare (\"Anas platyrhynchos\"), f\u00e2s\u0103 de lunc\u0103 (\"Anthus pratensis\"), f\u00e2s\u0103 de p\u0103dure (\"Anthus spinoletta\"), f\u00e2s\u0103 de p\u0103dure (\"Anthus trivialis\"), l\u0103stunul mare (\"Apus apus\"), st\u00e2rc cenu\u0219iu (\"Ardea cinerea\"), st\u00e2rc ro\u0219u (\"Ardea purpurea\"), caprimulg (\"Caprimulgus europaeus\"), scatiu (\"Carduelis spinus\"), prunda\u0219 gulerat mic (\"Charadrius dubius\"), barz\u0103 neagr\u0103 (\"Ciconia nigra\"), erete de stuf (\"Circus aeruginosus\"), erete v\u00e2n\u0103t (\"Circus cyaneus\"), erete cenu\u0219iu (\"Circus pygargus\"), porumbel gulerat (\"Columba palumbus\"), prepeli\u021b\u0103 (\"Coturnix coturnix\"), cuc (\"Cuculus canorus\"), l\u0103stun de cas\u0103 (\"Delichon urbica\"), m\u0103c\u0103leandru (\"Erithacus rubecula\"), \u0219oimul r\u00e2ndunelelor (\"Falco subbuteo\"), muscar negru (\"Ficedula hypoleuca\"), cintez\u0103 (\"Fringilla coelebs\"), cocor (\"Grus grus\"), acvil\u0103 pitic\u0103 (\"Hieraaetus pennatus\"), \"Hippolais polyglotta\", r\u00e2ndunic\u0103 (\"Hirundo rustica\"), cap\u00eentortur\u0103 (\"Jynx torquilla\"), sfr\u00e2ncioc cu cap ro\u0219u (\"Lanius senator\"), pesc\u0103ru\u0219 argintiu (\"Larus cachinnans\"), pesc\u0103ru\u0219 r\u00e2z\u0103tor (\"Larus ridibundus\"), privighetoare (\"Luscinia megarhynchos\"), prigoare (\"Merops apiaster\"), gaia neagr\u0103 (\"Milvus migrans\"), gaia ro\u0219ie (\"Milvus milvus\"), codobatura galben\u0103 (\"Motacilla flava\"), muscar sur (\"Muscicapa striata\"), grangur (\"Oriolus oriolus\"), ciuf-pitic (\"Otus scops\"), vultur pescar (\"Pandion haliaetus\"), viespar (\"Pernis apivorus\"), cormoran mare (\"Phalacrocorax carbo\"), codro\u0219 de munte (\"Phoenicurus ochruros\"), codro\u0219ul de p\u0103dure (\"Phoenicurus phoenicurus\"), pitulice de munte (\"Phylloscopus bonelli\"), pitulice de munte (\"Phylloscopus collybita\"), pitulice-fluier\u0103toare (\"Phylloscopus trochilus\"), brum\u0103ri\u021b\u0103 de p\u0103dure (\"Prunella modularis\"), cristei de balt\u0103 (\"Rallus aquaticus\"), pi\u021bigoi-pungar (\"Remiz pendulinus\"), l\u0103stun de mal (\"Riparia riparia\"), m\u0103r\u0103cinar (\"Saxicola rubetra\"), sitar de p\u0103dure (\"Scolopax rusticola\"), turturic\u0103 (\"Streptopelia turtur\"), silvie cu cap negru (\"Sylvia atricapilla\"), silvie de z\u0103voi (\"Sylvia borin\"), silvie ro\u0219cat\u0103 (\"Sylvia cantillans\"), silvie de c\u00e2mp (\"Sylvia communis\"), \"Sylvia hortensis\", fluierarul de z\u0103voi (\"Tringa ochropus\"), fluierarul cu picioare ro\u0219ii (\"Tringa totanus\"), p\u0103n\u021b\u0103ru\u0219ul (\"Troglodytes troglodytes\"), sturz-c\u00e2nt\u0103tor (\"Turdus philomelos\"), sturzul de v\u00e2sc (\"Turdus viscivorus\"), pup\u0103z\u0103 (\"Upupa epops\"), nag\u00e2\u021b (\"Vanellus vanellus\").\nPe l\u0