{"id": "3123683", "revid": "5350", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3123683", "title": "Valder\u00eda-Jamuz", "text": "Valder\u00eda-Jamuz este o arie protejat\u0103 (arie de protec\u021bie special\u0103 avifaunistic\u0103 \u2014 SPA) din Spania \u00eentins\u0103 pe o suprafa\u021b\u0103 de , integral pe uscat.\nLocalizare.\nCentrul sitului Valder\u00eda-Jamuz este situat la coordonatele .\n\u00cenfiin\u021bare.\nSitul Valder\u00eda-Jamuz a fost declarat arie de protec\u021bie special\u0103 avifaunistic\u0103 \u00een pentru a proteja 96 de specii de animale.\nBiodiversitate.\nSituat\u0103 \u00een ecoregiunea mediteranean\u0103, aria protejat\u0103 nu include niciun habitat protejat.\nLa baza desemn\u0103rii sitului se afl\u0103 mai multe specii protejate de p\u0103s\u0103ri (96): uliu porumbar (\"Accipiter gentilis\"), uliu p\u0103s\u0103rar (\"Accipiter nisus\"), l\u0103car mare (\"Acrocephalus arundinaceus\"), l\u0103car-de-lac (\"Acrocephalus scirpaceus\"), fluierar de munte (\"Actitis hypoleucos\"), cioc\u00e2rlie-de-c\u00e2mp (\"Alauda arvensis\"), pesc\u0103ru\u0219 albastru (\"Alcedo atthis\"), ra\u021b\u0103 mare (\"Anas platyrhynchos\"), f\u00e2s\u0103-de-c\u00e2mp (\"Anthus campestris\"), f\u00e2s\u0103 de lunc\u0103 (\"Anthus pratensis\"), f\u00e2s\u0103 de p\u0103dure (\"Anthus trivialis\"), l\u0103stunul mare (\"Apus apus\"), st\u00e2rc cenu\u0219iu (\"Ardea cinerea\"), pas\u0103rea ogorului (\"Burhinus oedicnemus\"), \u0219orecarul comun (\"Buteo buteo\"), cioc\u00e2rlie-cu-degete-scurte (\"Calandrella brachydactyla\"), c\u00e2nepar (\"Carduelis cannabina\"), sticlete (\"Carduelis carduelis\"), scatiu (\"Carduelis spinus\"), prunda\u0219 gulerat mic (\"Charadrius dubius\"), florinte (\"Chloris chloris\"), barz\u0103 alb\u0103 (\"Ciconia ciconia\"), erete v\u00e2n\u0103t (\"Circus cyaneus\"), erete cenu\u0219iu (\"Circus pygargus\"), \"Clamator glandarius\", porumbel de scorbur\u0103 (\"Columba oenas\"), porumbel gulerat (\"Columba palumbus\"